      "writtenOn": "2019-09-18T20:52:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See above. This is because the kernel driver exposes an interface that\u0027s really only used by ectool for the purposes of sending a raw packet.\n\nThe rest of the cros-ec drivers are there to act as adapters to whatever linux apis exist:\n* sensors go to iio\n* keyboard to input subsystem\n* type c stuff goes to extcon (to be changed in the future to the new upstream type c api)\n* i2c tunnel acts like an i2c controller",
